    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-[Archive] function and [Achievement] system are now live!-</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/fb06af5f1e4bf590859ab78e9d26b566.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br>Brave Player, fight and defend your towers! TOWER DEFENDER is a strategy TD game. Make deployment routes, release supernatural spells, conquer enemy towers and obtain victory. Defeat Dragon Boss and restore world peace!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/e021f8b9c44af4a2f4c1395f2d664a41.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br>500 years ago, five Guardians worked together to seal the evil dragon on the lava island. 500 years later, the dragon gradually woke up, and the world once again fell into crisis.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You, as the Commander of the Silver Knights, are endowed with the spells and skills of the Guardians. You can break through the casual mode to practice your skills, or you can challenge the dragon boss and fight to the death!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/04d77299db88955a7e239600290fa954.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added [Archive function], now you can freely archive the game progress<br></li><li>Added [Achievement System], unlock the level to get surprise rewards<br></li><li>Become a kingdom warrior, strategically attack towers, defeat the boss, and restore world peace<br></li><li>Multiple gameplay modes: Survival and Casual<br></li><li>Experience the changing scenes: Forest, Snowland, Desert, and Cemetry<br></li><li>Battle Experience: Your soldiers and towers will gradually become more powerful as you defeat more enemies and complete more levels<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-[Archive] function and [Achievement] system are now live!-</strong></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/b106b9e7d7274cf3b8d47212412f4a30.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/fb06af5f1e4bf590859ab78e9d26b566.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br>Brave Player, fight and defend your towers! TOWER DEFENDER is a strategy TD game. Make deployment routes, release supernatural spells, conquer enemy towers and obtain victory. Defeat Dragon Boss and restore world peace!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/d1af83ba234cb73cd423328d856b32a0.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/e021f8b9c44af4a2f4c1395f2d664a41.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br>500 years ago, five Guardians worked together to seal the evil dragon on the lava island. 500 years later, the dragon gradually woke up, and the world once again fell into crisis.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/5310a51f112b9c828bbcd0e27e98e465.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You, as the Commander of the Silver Knights, are endowed with the spells and skills of the Guardians. You can break through the casual mode to practice your skills, or you can challenge the dragon boss and fight to the death!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/04d77299db88955a7e239600290fa954.webp?t=1733127865\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Added [Archive function], now you can freely archive the game progress<br></li><li>Added [Achievement System], unlock the level to get surprise rewards<br></li><li>Become a kingdom warrior, strategically attack towers, defeat the boss, and restore world peace<br></li><li>Multiple gameplay modes: Survival and Casual<br></li><li>Experience the changing scenes: Forest, Snowland, Desert, and Cemetry<br></li><li>Battle Experience: Your soldiers and towers will gradually become more powerful as you defeat more enemies and complete more levels<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.poster.avif?t=1733127865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.webm?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054150/extras/652a5a270e5a05a38588d4b74771c544.mp4?t=1733127865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tower Defender is a strategy TD game with roguelike gameplay. Brave knight, draw the sword to defeat the dragon boss, and restore world peace!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cGreat game, very well done. Easy to jump in and get lost battling towers for hours!\u201d<br />\r\n5 Star \u2013 Lamplyghterr<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI must say this game is easy for VR sick people like me. Really well balanced, easy to rotate but there is no need to. Very engaging. Some levels would require a retry but it was good feeling when finally passing it. Recommended.\u201d<br />\r\n5 Star \u2013 kraskish<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cCould not stop playing. I like that the difficulty isn't progressive because after some stages...it's nice to get a less challenging level as a break.\u201d<br />\r\n5 Star \u2013 Togathic<br />\r\n",
